AC-1: real hosted state proves due alert, prolonged-incident suppression, digest preservation and one verified recovery
AC-2: lost acknowledgement and fresh invocation reconcile durable intent; hidden history never resends and drill retry is idempotent
AC-3: actual run provenance, default branch, disabled/foreign inputs and failure deduplication pass
AC-4: typed journal rejects malformed receipts and duplicate rows; protected GitHub-only workflow needs no external monitor
